1
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,800
With the full cooperation of the police,

2
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,000
all suspects involved in the case

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,060
have been captured.

4
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:18,460
Good.

5
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,980
Once again, thank you to the police

6
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,900
for your tremendous support and cooperation.

7
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:32,220
I also thank our Discipline and Inspection Committee team.

8
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,860
You did not let our team down.

9
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:35,860
Comrade Geng Qing.

10
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:38,260
Interrogate all suspects immediately.

11
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:38,720
Yes, sir.

12
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:45,560
Du Qingbo.

13
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,980
We are from the Jianzhou Discipline and Inspection Committee.

14
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,040
We are questioning you under the law.

15
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,900
I hope you take this seriously

16
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,880
and cooperate with the investigation.

17
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,720
Do you have anything to say?

18
00:00:59,060 --> 00:00:59,900
No.

19
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,860
I hope you pull back from the brink,

20
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,420
give yourself a chance,

21
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:08,540
and not break your loved ones' hearts.

22
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:11,060
What kind of act

23
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,940
are you putting on?

24
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,040
Are we that close?

25
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,860
I don't even know you.

26
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,800
Du Qingbo.

27
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:22,420
In this world,

28
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,480
anyone can claim they don't know me,

29
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:26,340
except you.

30
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:29,060
Do you need me to refresh your memory?

31
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:31,800
Back then,

32
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:34,040
when your parents passed away unexpectedly

33
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,740
and you were in so much pain,

34
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:39,500
who was by your side?

35
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,120
When your ex-wife divorced you

36
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:45,080
and you drank until you threw up blood,

37
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:47,860
who stayed by your side?

38
00:01:49,700 --> 00:01:51,020
When Yanyan was hospitalized

39
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:53,140
and you watched over her day and night,

40
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:54,620
who was by your side?

41
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,460
When your business struggled

42
00:01:56,460 --> 00:01:57,140
and hit walls everywhere,

43
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:57,940
under the heaviest pressure,

44
00:01:57,940 --> 00:01:59,100
who was by your side?

45
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:04,040
And now you tell me

46
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,680
you don't know me?

47
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,500
Did you even forget my name?

48
00:02:12,340 --> 00:02:13,200
Let me tell you.

49
00:02:14,820 --> 00:02:16,740
My name is Geng Qing!

50
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:30,060
Today, let's talk about

51
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,160
the Jianzhou Tunnel case from 5 years ago.

52
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,660
Before that, your company, Jinxin,

53
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,760
had never landed a multi-million project.

54
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:42,340
Yet completely out of the blue,

55
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,340
you suddenly secured

56
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:46,780
the 570-million Jianzhou Tunnel project.

57
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:48,360
Why?

58
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:51,820
According to our investigation,

59
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:55,380
at an exclusive outdoor gathering,

60
00:02:56,220 --> 00:02:57,980
you met someone called Young Master Qin.

61
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:01,680
Ever since then, your Jinxin Company

62
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:04,460
kept landing hundred-million projects.

63
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:05,860
It's fair to say

64
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:07,580
the Jianzhou Tunnel project

65
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:09,400
was the turning point of your life.

66
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:13,820
Young Master Qin, thank you so much.

67
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,340
Thank you for helping me secure

68
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,540
the bidding agency for Jianzhou Tunnel.

69
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,080
I chose you

70
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,140
not because you saved me back then,

71
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,780
but because I saw your ruthlessness.

72
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:23,620
I'm calling you now

73
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,340
to tell you

74
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,880
that for this Jianzhou Tunnel project,

75
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,400
you must award it to Yunhai Construction.

76
00:03:31,380 --> 00:03:32,160
Young Master Qin,

77
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,460
Yunhai Construction...

78
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:36,400
doesn't have a great reputation.

79
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,420
Do I need you to tell me that?

80
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:39,100
No,

81
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,340
Young Master Qin,

82
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,100
this is a tunnel project.

83
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,860
If it's botched, lives will be lost.

84
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,020
You've signed the agency contract anyway.

85
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,680
You can decide who gets the contract.

86
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,280
Though this might just be

87
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,600
the last contract you ever sign.

88
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:55,420
Yet on this very project you managed,

89
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:58,340
a major liability accident occurred,

90
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:00,300
leaving two dead and eight injured.

91
00:04:00,660 --> 00:04:02,200
The Jianzhou Tunnel case

92
00:04:02,420 --> 00:04:03,480
was closed long ago.

93
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:05,260
I'm not responsible.

94
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:10,300
Do you still remember that ledger?

95
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:12,540
Our public security department

96
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:13,920
has already decrypted it.

97
00:04:14,820 --> 00:04:15,820
And its contents,

98
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:17,480
we have fully uncovered as well.

99
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,420
Back then, Yunhai Construction simply

100
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:23,740
lacked the qualifications to take on

101
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,060
the Jianzhou Tunnel project.

102
00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:28,380
You rigged the process,

103
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,500
bribing the expert panel

104
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,260
and bribing public officials.

105
00:04:32,780 --> 00:04:34,120
If you hadn't pulled those strings,

106
00:04:34,380 --> 00:04:36,500
Yunhai would never have won that contract,

107
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:38,260
and the tragedy wouldn't have happened.

108
00:04:39,740 --> 00:04:40,740
Think about it.

109
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,240
A tunnel that should have met standards

110
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,480
collapsed.

111
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:47,200
Workers who should have gone home paid

112
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:48,300
to reunite with their families

113
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:49,900
died.

114
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:53,000
And who caused all of this?

115
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:54,140
It was you!

116
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,720
Du Qingbo.

117
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:01,220
Don't throw baseless accusations at me.

118
00:05:01,740 --> 00:05:03,180
Everything requires evidence.

119
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,600
Do you think

120
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:08,200
if we didn't have solid evidence,

121
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:09,740
we would have you sitting here?

122
00:05:10,660 --> 00:05:12,060
The Du Qingbo of the past

123
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,900
was a principled man with a bottom line.

124
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:17,460
Back then, you told me

125
00:05:18,140 --> 00:05:19,120
that in life,

126
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,840
90 percent of our worries

127
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,020
come from within ourselves.

128
00:05:22,780 --> 00:05:24,580
We shouldn't compare ourselves to others,

129
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,000
just be true to ourselves.

130
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:27,760
Yet look at you now.

131
00:05:28,580 --> 00:05:30,000
You've forgotten where you came from,

132
00:05:30,740 --> 00:05:32,400
and you've lost who you were.

133
00:05:34,340 --> 00:05:35,020
Furthermore,

134
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:37,220
the "Young Master Qin" you speak of,

135
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,180
criminal suspect Qin Bo,

136
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,400
was arrested by us

137
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,640
yesterday afternoon.

138
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:43,380
I believe very soon,

139
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:45,620
the whole truth will come to light.

140
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:48,280
By then, if you finally decide to talk,

141
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:51,940
it will be far too late.

142
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:53,940
Do you understand?

143
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,360
That day,

144
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:04,440
you showed up at the bid opening

145
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,560
and hosted the ceremony,

146
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,520
but Jiang Peiyao wasn't there.

147
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:11,860
That's when we knew

148
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,980
you had Jiang Peiyao flee with Yanyan.

149
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:15,880
Do you really think

150
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:17,680
Jiang Peiyao can get away?

151
00:06:20,220 --> 00:06:21,400
The cabin doors are now closed.

152
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:22,680
We will be taking off shortly.

153
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,920
Please fasten your seatbelts.

154
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:25,560
Make sure your seatbelts are fastened.

155
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:26,980
Fasten your seatbelt, little one.

156
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:30,700
We're preparing for takeoff.

157
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:48,340
Yanyan...

158
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:50,100
Where is she now?

159
00:06:51,860 --> 00:06:53,500
She's with my mother right now.

160
00:06:54,220 --> 00:06:55,500
She wanted me to tell you something.

161
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,060
Her exact words were,

162
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,580
"Dad,

163
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:04,540
I'm at Uncle Geng's place right now.

164
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:05,720
Dad,

165
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,840
don't worry.

166
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:08,360
I'm all grown up now.

167
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:10,380
I know what happened.

168
00:07:11,420 --> 00:07:12,020
Dad,

169
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,720
you once asked me

170
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:15,800
if I was happy.

171
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,540
I said yes.

172
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,060
I wasn't lying to you.

173
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:21,260
But the time I was happiest

174
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,740
was when you had the least money.

175
00:07:24,660 --> 00:07:26,780
Back then, you only had me,

176
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:28,300
and I only had you.

177
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:31,300
Seeing you work hard made you look so cool.

178
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:33,060
You were a real superhero to me.

179
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:36,040
Later, when you got rich,

180
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:38,580
you grew less and less happy.

181
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,920
And I wasn't that happy anymore either.

182
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:42,460
Dad,

183
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,100
I hope you can come home soon,

184
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:47,860
so we can be as happy as we used to be."

185
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,880
Yanyan is ten years old now.

186
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:54,420
In two years, she'll enter her teens.

187
00:07:56,140 --> 00:07:57,660
Teenagers

188
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:59,800
need a parent's companionship

189
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:01,100
and guidance the most.

190
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:04,020
As a father,

191
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:05,740
can you really bear

192
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,560
to miss out on

193
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:09,820
the best years of your daughter's life?

194
00:08:11,180 --> 00:08:12,380
I know

195
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:14,700
that without your presence,

196
00:08:15,980 --> 00:08:16,960
she won't be happy.

197
00:08:20,260 --> 00:08:21,180
Rest assured.

198
00:08:21,860 --> 00:08:23,080
With your daughter staying with me,

199
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,420
cared for by my mom and me,

200
00:08:25,820 --> 00:08:27,860
she won't suffer any harm or neglect.

201
00:08:30,380 --> 00:08:31,740
When you get out,

202
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:33,880
I'll bring her back to you,

203
00:08:33,980 --> 00:08:35,020
safe and sound,

204
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:36,560
right into your hands.

205
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,460
Every day you delay getting out

206
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,200
is another day she has to wait.

207
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:45,120
Don't wait until you're released,

208
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,260
only to find she's already all grown up.

209
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:57,060
If I plead guilty now,

210
00:08:58,580 --> 00:08:59,420
make a full confession,

211
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:00,500
and cooperate with your investigation,

212
00:09:03,340 --> 00:09:05,020
will that count as meritorious service?

213
00:09:06,460 --> 00:09:07,740
I can apply for that on your behalf.

214
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:12,540
As

215
00:09:15,220 --> 00:09:17,540
a leading firm in the bidding industry,

216
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,460
we should have adhered to

217
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,960
fairness and equity under regulation.

218
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,720
Yet tempted by financial gains,

219
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,980
I compromised the panel experts,

220
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:29,860
leaked base bid prices,

221
00:09:30,220 --> 00:09:31,420
manipulated scoring,

222
00:09:32,780 --> 00:09:34,020
and ensured our company won the bids.

223
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,600
I plead guilty.

224
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:45,980
In the Jianzhou Tunnel Project,

225
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,680
the Jianzhou Xiba Project,

226
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,500
and the Lu'an Group projects,

227
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,820
during the bidding process,

228
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,440
we targeted experts,

229
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,380
paid bribes,

230
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,900
secured high technical scores,

231
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,320
colluded with the syndicate involved,

232
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:58,760
and joined other firms

233
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:01,020
to sell, rig, and collude on bids.

234
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:02,740
We leaked the base bid prices in advance,

235
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,140
bribed evaluation experts,

236
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,160
and during the review,

237
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,620
manipulated the scores

238
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:09,020
to ensure designated firms won.

239
00:10:09,620 --> 00:10:10,340
Afterward,

240
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,800
we split the spoils among ourselves.

241
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:15,260
I admit my crimes are grave.

242
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:17,380
I damaged the business environment

243
00:10:18,020 --> 00:10:19,800
and forgot why I started my business.

244
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:22,540
Even more, I failed those

245
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,940
who were killed and injured,

246
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,520
and the families and children left behind.

247
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:29,900
Although this case has been solved,

248
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:33,000
it gives us much food for thought.

249
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,780
The bidding process

250
00:10:34,820 --> 00:10:36,840
was to prevent corruption at the source,

251
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,340
ensuring openness,

252
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:39,740
fairness, impartiality,

253
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:41,260
and selection of the best.

254
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,600
Yet this case exposed that,

255
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,540
under the manipulation of criminals,

256
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:49,000
the rigorous steps in this system

257
00:10:49,100 --> 00:10:51,540
were compromised one by one in the dark.

258
00:10:51,780 --> 00:10:53,120
The bidding process

259
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,100
became a legal front

260
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:56,180
for all sides to carve up the spoils.

261
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:57,760
This makes it clear that

262
00:10:58,420 --> 00:10:59,700
in the bidding sector,

263
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,380
using cases to drive reform and governance

264
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:03,000
still requires much work.

265
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:05,560
If the rules of bidding are broken,

266
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:08,380
it results in layered subcontracting

267
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,920
and illicit kickbacks.

268
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:12,160
In the end, who suffers for it?

269
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:13,820
None other than our

270
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:15,880
hardworking citizens,

271
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:20,260
ordinary people still striving for dreams.

272
00:11:21,140 --> 00:11:21,920
Comrades,

273
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,980
facing corrupt individuals of all kinds,

274
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:28,320
we must stay relentless on this path,

275
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:29,780
never pausing for a step,

276
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,200
never yielding an inch,

277
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,500
advancing together so that officials

278
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,520
dare not be corrupt,

279
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:35,000
cannot be corrupt,

280
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:35,920
and have no desire to be corrupt.

281
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:38,840
We must wage this tough war on corruption,

282
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,820
a war of endurance and an all-out battle,

283
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,400
letting the light of openness and justice

284
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:46,300
shine on every bidding venue

285
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:49,300
and into every corner of our city.

286
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,280
Through our tireless efforts,

287
00:11:51,460 --> 00:11:52,760
let our people

